Apparently a monster using a level-draining artifact on the player gets
hurt rather than healed: in function artifact_hit() (artifact.c:1160)
the relevant line is:

    magr->mhp += (u.uhpmax - oldhpmax)/2;

but u.uhpmax was just reduced by losexp() and is now less than oldhpmax,
thus the right side is nonpositive.

I found this just recently in 3.4.1 after the game crashed when Cyclops
died, but the code in 3.4.2 seems to be the same.

